research/audit/wave7-certifier-tasks/ex-abel-dini-pair-for-the-harmonic-series.md-161-$$\sum_{n} \frac{a_n}{S_n} \;=\; \sum_{n} \frac{1}{(n+1)\,H_{n+1}} \quad \text{diverges}, \qquad \sum_{n} \frac{a_n}{S_n^{2}} \;=\; \sum_{n} \frac{1}{(n+1)\,H_{n+1}^{2}} \quad \text{converges} .$$
