items/thm-abel-limit-theorem.md-27-**Given:** Inclusive partial sums $S_n:=\sum_{k=0}^{n}a_k$ with $S_n\to s$.
items/thm-abel-limit-theorem.md-28-
items/thm-abel-limit-theorem.md:29:[L1] Finite Abel summation gives $\sum_{k=0}^{N}a_kx^k=S_Nx^N+(1-x)\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}S_kx^k$ ([[lem-abel-summation-by-parts]]).
items/thm-abel-limit-theorem.md-30-
items/thm-abel-limit-theorem.md-31-[L2] A convergent sequence is bounded ([[lem-convergent-implies-bounded]]).
