items/ex-coordinates-depend-on-the-ordered-basis.md-71-[L4] Finite sums: $\sum_{i<2}u_i = (0_V + u_0) + u_1 = u_0 + u_1$ ([[def-monoid-finite-product]], [[def-linear-combination-and-span]]).
items/ex-coordinates-depend-on-the-ordered-basis.md-72-
