research/audit/wave7-judge-adjudications.jsonl-1-{"id":"ex-rational-function-field-order","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","context_sha256":"d4c9958f6e312f0813641e9ff2f30e8e5bf20ddbbbb18e5a28964b39ff6d62fb","outcome":"confirmed_nonfatal","item_sha256":"9cdd2dabbcf8367cedd558f4fd65d2f6f98bf138c6791387583408e50625683c","adjudicator":"audit-alpha (gpt-5.6-sol, xhigh; owner-delegated)","at":"2026-08-08T19:32:01Z","note":"Terra is right that L2 bundles standard polynomial arithmetic not separately stated by all three cited targets, but it overlooks the load-bearing source. The cited cex-ordered-field-not-archimedean proves verbatim, 'Thus $p(x)$ and $q(x)$ eventually have the signs of $a_m$ and $b_n$, respectively'. Multiplying leading terms gives lc(pq)=lc(p)lc(q) in one line; finite-root language is unused. This closes inside thirty seconds, so R1 forbids a repair."}
